sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User / CLI
    participant K as Keystone
    participant N as nova-api<br/>+ keystonemiddleware
    participant G as neutron / glance
    U->>K: password or app credential
    K-->>U: Fernet token<br/>(scope and roles frozen in cache)
    U->>N: request + X-Auth-Token
    N->>K: validate token<br/>(service password, plaintext, cached)
    K-->>N: project, roles
    N->>N: oslo.policy on the frozen roles
    N->>G: user token + X-Service-Token
    G->>K: validate both (cached)
